        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F62ADD, Contemporary Addison Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and will fit door thicknesses from 1-5/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. A grade 1 lock it is made with a rugged all-metal chassis for added security. A double cylinder handleset, it is operated by a key on both the interior and exterior; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt on this double cylinder handleset is thrown or retracted by a key from the both the exterior and the interior. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the exterior and by a turn knob on the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/addison-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60add\"><b>Addison Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/addison-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93add\"><b>Addison Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Cylinder Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Length: 12-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Addison Double Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F62ADD",
                "description": "Addison Double Cylinder Handleset Schlage F-ADD - The traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. It is a grade 1 lock. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Will fit door thicknesses from 1-5/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. Available in 7 finishes. A double cylinder handleset, it is locked and unlocked by a key on both sides of the door. This type of lock is most often used on doors located near windows.",
                "keywords": "SCH-f62ADD, Schlage addison handlesets, schlage f62add, schlage Double cylinder handlesets, grade 1 handlesets, square handlesets, traditional front door handlesets, traditional handlesets, schlage f series Double cylinder handlesets,"
            },
